    {
      "key": "team.listening.c1.why-does-climate-change-matter.00add4a7d6824b17bc241289f4b24eb9",
      "kind": "ListeningTranscriptLine",
      "values": {
        "OrderIndex": 5,
        "Speaker": "Narrator",
        "Text": "We\u0027re seeing more extreme events like heatwaves and heavy rainfall and wildfire.",
        "VietnameseMeaning": "Ch\u00FAng ta \u0111ang th\u1EA5y nhi\u1EC1u s\u1EF1 ki\u1EC7n c\u1EF1c \u0111oan h\u01A1n nh\u01B0 s\u00F3ng nhi\u1EC7t, m\u01B0a l\u1EDBn v\u00E0 ch\u00E1y r\u1EEBng.",
        "StartTime": 29.3,
        "EndTime": 33.2
      },
      "references": {
        "LessonId": "team.listening.c1.why-does-climate-change-matter"
      }
    },
    {
      "key": "team.listening.c1.why-does-climate-change-matter.0a2dd30dd06a44cea0d0a10f1e96b3fc",
      "kind": "ListeningTranscriptLine",
      "values": {
        "OrderIndex": 6,
        "Speaker": "Narrator",
        "Text": "And we know that a lot of those effects are going to increase with more warming.",
        "VietnameseMeaning": "V\u00E0 ch\u00FAng t\u00F4i bi\u1EBFt nhi\u1EC1u t\u00E1c \u0111\u1ED9ng \u0111\u00F3 s\u1EBD t\u0103ng l\u00EAn khi Tr\u00E1i \u0110\u1EA5t \u1EA5m th\u00EAm.",
        "StartTime": 33.2,
        "EndTime": 38.3
      },
      "references": {
        "LessonId": "team.listening.c1.why-does-climate-change-matter"
      }
    },
    {
      "key": "team.listening.c1.why-does-climate-change-matter.0ad355e7171048208c00b19975461c92",
      "kind": "ListeningTranscriptLine",
      "values": {
        "OrderIndex": 10,
        "Speaker": "Narrator",
        "Text": "We know more about our planet than we have ever before, and we learn more every day. So we know why climate is changing.",
        "VietnameseMeaning": "Ch\u00FAng ta bi\u1EBFt v\u1EC1 h\u00E0nh tinh c\u1EE7a m\u00ECnh nhi\u1EC1u h\u01A1n bao gi\u1EDD h\u1EBFt, v\u00E0 m\u1ED7i ng\u00E0y ch\u00FAng ta l\u1EA1i bi\u1EBFt th\u00EAm. V\u00EC v\u1EADy ch\u00FAng ta bi\u1EBFt v\u00EC sao kh\u00ED h\u1EADu \u0111ang thay \u0111\u1ED5i.",
        "StartTime": 51.8,
        "EndTime": 58.8
      },
      "references": {
        "LessonId": "team.listening.c1.why-does-climate-change-matter"
      }
    },
    {
