        "Speaker": "Narrator",
        "Text": "And what we see is that the planet\u0027s climate is changing. The last years have been the warmest since modern record-keeping began.",
        "VietnameseMeaning": "V\u00E0 \u0111i\u1EC1u ch\u00FAng t\u00F4i th\u1EA5y l\u00E0 kh\u00ED h\u1EADu c\u1EE7a h\u00E0nh tinh \u0111ang thay \u0111\u1ED5i. Nh\u1EEFng n\u0103m g\u1EA7n \u0111\u00E2y l\u00E0 nh\u1EEFng n\u0103m \u1EA5m nh\u1EA5t k\u1EC3 t\u1EEB khi b\u1EAFt \u0111\u1EA7u c\u00F3 ghi ch\u00E9p hi\u1EC7n \u0111\u1EA1i.",
